                {
                    "text": "A ratio counts parts. Order matters."
                },
                {
                    "text": "To simplify, divide both numbers by the same number. The HCF does it in one step."
                },
                {
                    "text": "Simplest form means you can't divide both numbers again."
                },
                {
                    "text": "For a fraction, put one part over the total of the parts."
